        "acetate films"@en,
        "nitrato de celulosa"@es ;
    skos:definition "A cellulose acetate resin sheet that is transparent, air proof, hygenic, and resistent to grease, oil, and dust; used for photographic film, magnetic tapes, and as a protective material. Film which has a base of cellulose acetate, diacetate, or triacetate; like nitrate film. It is highly unstable (AAT)."@en ;
