euf:10666 a skos:Concept ;
    skos:definition "Works dating from the 1960s or later that use their exhibition space as part of their design. Demanding a viewer's active engagement, installations are often created by artists in direct opposition to the notion of permanent artwork, or art as a commodity. (AAT)"@en ;
    skos:inScheme lev:europeana-fashion ;
    skos:prefLabel "Installation"@de,
        "εγκατάσταση"@el,
        "installation"@en,
