        "sceneggiatura in costume"@it ;
    skos:definition "Each character’s costume is broken down by scene and numbered chronologically. Costume change numbers become all the more complicated during long chase scenes and action sequences when there are multiple units shooting and when there are special effects (UCLA)"@en ;
