        "matrozenpakken"@nl ;
    skos:definition "Boys or girls' suits inspired by French or British marine-uniforms: blouses or jackets and trousers or skirts in white and blue, adorned with stripes in the contrasting color. The upper-body garment is also characterized by a flat collar that forms a rectangle down the back (AAT)"@en ;
    skos:inScheme lev:europeana-fashion ;
