        "repousser"@en,
        "reliefarbete"@sv ;
    skos:definition "In metalwork, a technique for decorating a surface by hammering the reverse of the object, sometimes into a mold of wood that has been carved in intaglio, to create designs in relief (AAT)."@en ;
