aat:300129425 a skos:Concept ;
    skos:definition "Large or decorative vessels, especially ones with an ornamental foot or pedestal, that usually have a mouth that is smaller than the body, and which often have two side handles."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lev:aat ;
    skos:prefLabel "urns"@en .

aat:300129439 a skos:Concept ;
    skos:definition "Books, set of books, or disks, containing informational articles on subjects in every field of knowledge, or limited to a special field or subject, usually arranged in alphabetical order."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lev:aat ;
    skos:prefLabel "encyclopedias"@en .

aat:300129523 a skos:Concept ;
    skos:definition "Structures comprising or focused on gates or gateways."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lev:aat ;
    skos:prefLabel "gate structures"@en .

aat:300129541 a skos:Concept ;
    skos:definition "Commercial buildings built for use by the sector of industry where no goods are produced, yet the industry is in service to businesses and consumers."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lev:aat ;
    skos:prefLabel "service industry buildings"@en .

aat:300129542 a skos:Concept ;
    skos:definition "Relatively small dwellings containing two or more living units for people not of the same family or household, where each dwelling does not necessarily have a full range of residential facilities so that residents must share certain common areas, such as a kitchen, bathroom, and sitting room. Examples include dwellings used as temporary transitional residences. Distinguished from larger \"multiple dwellings,\" which contain relatively complete residential units for multiple households within a single building or complex that has a smaller number of common areas, such as a laundry room."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lev:aat ;
    skos:prefLabel "group dwellings"@en .

aat:300129621 a skos:Concept ;
