aat:300446375 a skos:Concept ;
    skos:definition "In Indian art and architecture, a circular medallion as decorative motif."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lev:aat ;
    skos:prefLabel "Indumaṇḍala"@en .

aat:300446376 a skos:Concept ;
    skos:definition "In Indian architecture, a circular purlin; circular roof-covering; rafters."@en ;
