aat:300446400 a skos:Concept ;
    skos:definition "In Indian architecture, a complex multi-spired superstructure-type; Anēkāṇḍaka śikhara Variation of spire in Northern Indian temples. One or two rows of half spires are on either side; miniature shikharas adorn the base and corners."@en ;
