mimo:2820 a skos:Concept ;
    skos:definition "A gong is a percussion instrument originating in East Asia and Southeast Asia. Gongs are a flat, circular metal disc that is typically struck with a mallet. They can be small or large in size, and tuned or can require tuning."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lev:mimo ;
    skos:prefLabel "Gong"@ca,
