    skos:definition "The yunluo (simplified: 云锣; traditional: 雲鑼 pinyin: yúnluó, [y̌nlu̯ɔ̌]; literally \"cloud gongs\" or \"cloud of gongs\"), is a traditional Chinese musical instrument. It is made up of a set of gongs of varying sizes held within a frame. It was also called yún'áo (雲璈) in ancient times."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lev:mimo ;
    skos:prefLabel "Yunluo"@ca,
