mimo:2877 a skos:Concept ;
    skos:altLabel "Bell tree"@zh,
        "Trump"@zh ;
    skos:definition "A Turkish crescent, (a smaller version is called a çevgen or çağana (Tr.), Turkish jingle, Jingling Johnny, Schellenbaum (Ger.), chapeau chinois or pavillon chinois (Fr.)), is a percussion instrument traditionally used by military bands internationally. In some contexts it also serves as a battle trophy or object of veneration."@en ;
