        "Calichon"@zh,
        "Gallichon"@zh,
        "Kra-chapee"@zh,
        "Kuban"@zh ;
    skos:definition "The mandora or gallichon is a type of 18th- and early 19th-century lute, with six to nine courses of strings. The terms were interchangeable, with mandora more commonly used from the mid-18th century onwards."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lev:mimo ;
    skos:prefLabel "Mandora"@ca,
