        "Lotar"@zh,
        "P'anduri"@zh,
        "Phanduri"@zh ;
    skos:definition "The panduri (Georgian: ფანდური) is a traditional Georgian three-string plucked instrument common in all regions of Eastern Georgia: such as Pshav-Khevsureti, Tusheti, Kakheti and Kartli. The panduri is generally used to accompany solo heroic, comic and love songs, as well as dance. It is typically played by men."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lev:mimo ;
    skos:prefLabel "Panduri"@ca,
        "Panduri"@de,
