        "Fue"@sv,
        "Fue"@zh .

mimo:3968 a skos:Concept ;
    skos:definition "The fujara (Slovak pronunciation: [ˈfujara]) is a large wind instrument of the tabor pipe class. It originated in central Slovakia as a sophisticated folk shepherd's overtone fipple flute of unique design in the contrabass range."@en ;
