mimo:3976 a skos:Concept ;
    skos:definition "The gemshorn is an instrument of the ocarina family that was historically made from the horn of a chamois, goat, or other suitable animal. The gemshorn receives its name from the German language, in which Gemshorn means a \"chamois horn\"."@en ;
