mimo:4075 a skos:Concept ;
    skos:altLabel "Seruling"@zh,
        "Sikura"@zh ;
    skos:definition "The suling or seruling (Sundanese: ᮞᮥᮜᮤᮀ) is a musical instrument of the Sundanese people in western Java, Indonesia. It is used in the Degung ensemble. Bamboo ring flute can also be found in Southeast Asian, especially in Brunei, Indonesia, Malaysia, the Philippines and Singapore."@en ;
