mimo:4193 a skos:Concept ;
    skos:definition "Diple, (pluralia tantum; pronounced [dîple̞], other Croatian names: \"misnjiče\", \"miješnice\" and \"mih\") is a traditional woodwind musical instrument originating in the Adriatic Littoral. It is played in Bosnia and Herzegovina, Croatia, Slovenia, Montenegro, and Serbia"@en ;
