mimo:4197 a skos:Concept ;
    skos:altLabel "Englisches Horn"@de,
        "English horn"@en,
        "English horn"@zh,
        "Lusheng"@zh ;
    skos:definition "The cor anglais (UK: /ˌkɔːr ˈɒŋɡleɪ/, US: /- ɑːŋˈɡleɪ/ or original French: [kɔʁ ɑ̃ɡlɛ]; plural: cors anglais), or English horn in North America, is a double-reed woodwind instrument in the oboe family. It is approximately one and a half times the length of an oboe, making it essentially an alto oboe in F."@en ;
