mimo:6526 a skos:Concept ;
    skos:definition "A Chemnitzer concertina is a musical instrument of the hand-held bellows-driven free-reed category, sometimes called squeezeboxes. The Chemnitzer concertina is most closely related to the bandoneón (German spelling: Bandonion), more distantly to the other concertinas, and accordions."@en ;
    skos:inScheme lev:mimo ;
    skos:prefLabel "Concertina de Chemnitzer"@ca,
        "Chemnitzer Konzertina"@de,
        "Chemnitzer concertina"@en,
